    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12616" root="دعو" body-key="d">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندعى</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجَابَ</span>. (K.) Akh heard one
or more of the Arabs say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْدَعَوْنَا لَٱنْدَعَيْنَا</span>, meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَأَجُبْنَا</span> [i. e. <i>Had they called us,</i> &amp;c., <i>we had
certainly answered,</i> or <i>replied,</i> or <i>assented,</i> or
<i>consented</i>]. (S.)

